{
  "info": {
    "name": "Best Buy API Playground",
    "description": "Complete Postman collection for the Best Buy API Playground (Spring Boot).\n\nA RESTful API training tool with 51,000+ products, 1,500+ stores, and 4,300+ categories.\n\n## Base URL\n`http://localhost:3030`\n\n## Pagination\nAll list endpoints support `$limit` (default 10, max 25) and `$skip` (default 0).\n\n## Filtering\n- Products: filter by `category.id` or `category.name`\n- Stores: filter by `service.id`, `service.name`, or geolocation (`near` + `miles`)\n\n## Read-only Mode\nWhen `app.readonly=true`, all write operations return 405.",
    "_postman_id": "bestbuy-api-playground-spring-boot",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3030",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Products",
